# Google tag (gtag.js) + Consent Mode v2.
# Set the real value as an Environment Variable in Vercel (Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables), for Production ONLY — previews and local dev must not
# send data to Ads. Leave it empty locally to keep tracking disabled.
# Exposed to the client bundle (VITE_ prefix) — do not put secrets here.

# The Google tag id (Google Ads → gtag install), format: AW-XXXXXXXXXX
VITE_GOOGLE_TAG_ID=

# NOTE: Google Ads conversion labels are NOT env vars: they live in code, under
# test, in src/lib/conversions.js (enquiry form, email click, WhatsApp click).
